    # mc "I get that it's hard for you and Derek to open up about it."
    mc "我明白，你和Derek很难把这些事说出口。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:245
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_1f9cfc14:

    # my "It's been hard, yes. I haven't been able to tell anyone about it, but I've wanted to for so long."
    my "是的，很难。我一直没能跟任何人说这件事，但我想说很久了。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:246
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_8854b54e:

    # mc "Has Patrick always been this way?"
    mc "Patrick一直都这样吗？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:248
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_b44ee7ae:

    # my "He's been angry for many years."
    my "这么多年来，他总是动不动就发火。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:249
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_8d3e89c1:

    # my "Especially when he feels like he's losing control over a situation."
    my "尤其是当他觉得自己在失去对局面的控制时。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:250
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_e43fb99e:

    # my "I push his buttons a lot when I speak up for Mom, but he doesn't always know how to deal with her, which makes me mad."
    my "我替妈妈说话时，常会惹怒他。可他有时候根本不知道该怎么照顾妈妈，这让我很生气。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:252
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_d418633c:

    # mc "That's not a reason for him to abuse you like that. In fact, there's no reason for it."
    mc "这也不是他这样虐待你的理由。事实上，不管怎样，他都不该这么做。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:254
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_d64fb3c8:

    # my "What he does is... Well, you saw what he did."
    my "他这么做……嗯，你看到他做了什么。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:255
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_be95872b:

    # my "I wasn't lying when I said he doesn't hit me. But he can grab my arm pretty hard or shove me when he argues... I don't like that."
    my "我没说谎，我说他没打过我。但他在争吵时会用力抓我的手臂，或者推我……我一点都不喜欢这样。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:256
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_05c9e33f:

    # my "When I was younger, I questioned myself a lot. Like, maybe I did something wrong to deserve it."
    my "小时候我经常怀疑自己，觉得自己是不是做错了什么，才招来这样的事。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:257
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_48e71641:

    # my "But I don't think I always did."
    my "可我不觉得每次都是我做错了。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:259
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_c80e8771:

    # mc "Why haven't you told anyone about it?"
    mc "你为什么不告诉别人这件事？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:261
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_c785863f:

    # my "Because it doesn't happen all the time."
    my "因为他也不是一直都这样。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:262
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_2df2f0f1:

    # my "But mostly because it feels like I would be turning on my family if I did."
    my "但更主要的是，我觉得一旦说出去，就像背叛了家人。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:263
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_0ed11d1f:

    # my "And I don't want to turn on my family like Dad turned on me."
    my "我不想像爸爸对我那样，转过头来伤害自己的家人。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:265
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_e5be6bf0:

    # mc "For your mom's sake?"
    mc "为你妈妈着想？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:267
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_089998f2:

    # my "For Mom, too. Yes."
    my "为了妈妈，也是。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:270
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_1fd2dbe4:

    # my "Why did you punch him?"
    my "为什么你打他？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:272
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_eea5d9a8:

    # mc "I got so mad when I realized what he'd put you through."
    mc "知道他让你受了那些苦，我实在气坏了。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:273
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_96e8f4a5:

    # mc "I wanted to hurt him for hurting you."
    mc "我想伤害他，因为他伤害了你。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:275
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_fc645303_1:

    # my "..."
    my "..."

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:277
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_5c292885:

    # mc "But after I did, I saw you still care for him... And I felt terrible."
    mc "但在我这么做之后，我看到你仍然在乎他……我感觉很糟。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:278
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_977f1bdd:

    # mc "I couldn't understand how you could still defend him until I talked to Derek."
    mc "我一直不明白，你为什么还会维护他，直到跟Derek聊过之后才懂。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:280
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_25c216ba:

    # my "What did Derek say?"
    my "Derek说了什么？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:282
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_a57665ac:

    # mc "That it's because he's still your dad."
    mc "那是因为他还是你爸。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:283
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_cd92e38e:

    # mc "I try to picture my dad ever doing that to me and how I would react in the same situation, but I can't relate to it."
    mc "我试着想象我爸如果对我这么做，我会怎么反应，但就是没法感同身受。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:284
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_28a9932d:

    # mc "Because that's not what a parent should be like to begin with."
    mc "因为那根本就不是当父母该有的样子。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:286
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_fc645303_2:

    # my "..."
    my "..."

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:288
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_9bcdb592:

    # my "I wish you hadn't done it. But I understand why you did."
    my "我希望你没这么做。但我明白你为什么这么做。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:291
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_b1fd6ac6:

    # my "I've never seen anyone stand up to Dad the way you did."
    my "我从没见过有人敢像你这样顶撞我爸。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:292
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_0ef4f351:

    # my "I was scared about how he would react when you called him out like that."
    my "我担心他听到你那样当面指出他时会怎么反应。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:293
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_e4e0d9aa:

    # my "And then he backed off... I think he realized that he did something wrong."
    my "然后他退缩了……我想他意识到自己做错了事。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:295
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_379fcd6e:

    # mc "You think?"
    mc "你这么想？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:297
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_928b416e:

    # my "Then again, I've been hoping he would realize that long ago. Maybe I'm being naive again..."
    my "说真的，我早就在盼着他早点明白这点了。也许我又在天真地想事情了……"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:300
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_a1c8f9ce:

    # my "Thank you for handling it so well...when I argued with Dad."
    my "谢谢你当时处理得这么好……当我跟爸爸吵架的时候。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:301
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_a29ec857:

    # my "I feel like you disarmed him and made him feel regret."
    my "我觉得你让他没法再强硬下去，也让他后悔了。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:302
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_5f9937c8:

    # my "But maybe that's wishful thinking..."
    my "但也许这只是我一厢情愿的幻想……"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:304
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_2c9749c1:

    # mc "I was torn about how to act. I was boiling mad on the inside, but it didn't feel like getting angry would accomplish anything."
    mc "我纠结着该怎么做。我心里气得要命，但感觉发火也没用。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:305
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_f058a533:

    # mc "And in that split second, I had to think about how it could have affected you. I didn't want to make it worse."
    mc "那一瞬间，我得想想这会对你造成什么影响。我不想让事情变得更糟。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:309
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_91cb8799:

    # mc "I hope I didn't make things worse for you by doing that..."
    mc "我希望我没有因为那样做而让你更难受……"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:311
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_51697ea5:

    # my "I don't think you did. I hope it was a wake-up call for him."
    my "我觉得你没做错。我希望这能成为他醒悟的契机。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:313
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_d1aceb07:

    # mc "I hope so, too."
    mc "我也希望如此。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:334
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_b4bbc60c:

    # my "Have I ever told you why I chose to study social work?"
    my "我有没有跟你说过我为什么选择学习社会工作？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:336
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_0eddc5c5:

    # mc "No, you haven't."
    mc "没，你还没说过。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:338
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_8cf9d346:

    # my "It's because I want to help families in similar situations as mine."
    my "因为我想要帮助像我家庭一样处境的家庭。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:339
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_4f2e3631:

    # my "I never asked for help, yet that's my calling because I can understand the pain and suffering involved."
    my "我从未主动寻求帮助，但这就是我的使命，因为我能理解其中的痛苦与折磨。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:341
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_4a7690f6:

    # my "And maybe I will have an easier time spotting that it's happening to someone than others would."
    my "也许我会比别人更容易察觉，有人正在遭受这种对待。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:342
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_2ac6bd06:

    # my "And I also know that these situations are rarely just black and white. There's a shade of gray that's hard for many to understand."
    my "而且这些情况很少是非黑即白的。中间那层灰色，很多人其实很难理解。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:343
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_6aa6cf92:

    # my "I think you need that kind of understanding to deal with this."
    my "我觉得你得有这种理解才能应对这一切。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:347
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_5d078243:

    # my "And now, thanks to you, I get to study it and figure out who I am with you and Josy."
    my "现在多亏了你，我能继续学下去，也能在和你、Josy相处的过程中，慢慢找回自己。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:349
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_30d5de50:

    # my "And now, thanks to you, I get to study it and figure out who I am with Josy."
    my "现在多亏了你，我能继续学下去，也能在和Josy相处的过程中，慢慢找回自己。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:350
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_01474e28:

    # my "I want to feel and decide for myself without the layer of fear that Dad would find out."
    my "我想自己感受、自己决定，而不用再担心爸爸会发现。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:355
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_1119e33d:

    # mc "And you truly deserve it. I want to be there with you when you turn this next page."
    mc "你真的配得上这一切。我也想在你翻开下一页的时候陪在你身边。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:358
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_0947b00b:

    # my "I want that, too..."
    my "我也想要。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:360
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_e7dd8341:

    # mc "Good..."
    mc "好……"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:363
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_955e822b:

    # my "You will be."
    my "你会的。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:366
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_7fced289:

    # mc "And you truly deserve it. It's what Josy has wanted for you, too. She's put up with a lot for you."
    mc "而且你确实配得上这一切。Josy也一直希望你能拥有这样的自由，她为了你忍受了很多。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:368
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_fc645303_3:

    # my "..."
    my "..."

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:371
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_2a4e7a10:

    # my "Is that what you feel and want, though?"
    my "那这就是你真正感觉和想要的吗？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:373
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_f6307fde:

    # mc "Well... You know how I feel about you. But all I want is for you to be happy."
    mc "好吧……你清楚我对你是什么感觉。但唯一我希望的是你能开心。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:375
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_09b1753e:

    # my "Thank you, [name]."
    my "谢谢，[name]."

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:377
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_16297ebd:

    # my "That's why college means a lot to me. And while Dad tries to control my life choices, college is my choice and mine alone."
    my "这就是为什么大学对我意义重大。虽然我爸总想控制我的人生选择，但大学是我自己的选择，是我一个人的。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:378
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_ed897658:

    # my "If I find a way to endure until college is over, I can have anything I want after."
    my "如果我能撑到大学结束，之后想要什么都能得到。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:380
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_edda61ed:

    # my "And when I look at Mom and see how she endures her suffering... Day after day, she's constantly fighting..."
    my "当我看着妈妈，看到她如何日复一日地忍受痛苦……她一直在不断挣扎着活下去……"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:381
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_0b406032:

    # my "It's unbelievable how she can keep going, but somehow she manages."
    my "她能坚持下去简直让人难以置信，可她偏偏还是撑过来了。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:382
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_747ced2d:

    # my "I want to keep going, too. And unlike Mom, I see the day when I can be free ahead of me. So, if I keep going for longer, eventually, it'll be over."
    my "我也想继续下去。和妈妈不一样，我看得到自由的那一天。所以，如果我能坚持更久，总有一天，这一切都会结束。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:384
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_3f2308a9:

    # my "And that's why I choose to continue this way."
    my "这就是我选择继续这样下去的原因。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:385
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_62badbc0:

    # my "I'm unsure if Josy can accept that...and it sucks that we still have to hide. But college means too much to me to give it up."
    my "我不确定Josy能不能接受这个现实……而且我们还得继续藏起来，真是烦人。但对我来说，大学太重要了，不能放弃。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:390
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_75cdb658:

    # mc "This will be hard for Josy. I know it."
    mc "这对Josy来说会很难，我知道。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:391
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_296d5802:

    # mc "As for me, I'll support you in whatever you choose. Even if you backpedal in the future, ok?"
    mc "至于我，我会支持你做出的任何选择。就算你以后想回头，也没关系？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:394
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_205f515f:

    # my "You would, wouldn't you?"
    my "你真的会，对吧？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:396
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_0b0e8a7b:

    # mc "All I want is for you to be happy."
    mc "我只希望你能幸福。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:399
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_57e557c2:

    # mc "It's great that you know what you want, but don't forget Josy's feelings."
    mc "你清楚自己想要什么很好，但别忘了 Josy 的感受。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:400
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_900e5d45:

    # mc "She's supported you so much and wants to find ways for this to work, too."
    mc "她一直支持你，也想找到办法让这一切继续下去。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:401
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_021c8d80:

    # mc "And while you've come to terms with that nothing will change, it feels like she will have a much harder time accepting that."
    mc "你已经接受了现状不会改变，可她要接受这一点，恐怕比你难得多。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:403
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_fc645303_4:

    # my "..."
    my "..."

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:405
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_896b6686:

    # my "I'm not going to forget about her. And I will talk with her."
    my "我不会忘记她的。我也会跟她谈谈。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:406
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_ff3c1052:

    # my "I'm pushing through with college, and I want to find a way to push through with us, too. I think..."
    my "我在继续读大学，我也想找到办法，让我们一起走下去。我想..."

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:408
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_32e9eff6:

    # mc "Good... You should."
    mc "好……你该这么做。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:411
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_05c7ff76:

    # my "You think so?"
    my "你这么想吗？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:413
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_f6307fde_1:

    # mc "Well... You know how I feel about you. But all I want is for you to be happy."
    mc "嗯……你知道我对你的感情。但我只想让你幸福。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:415
translate schinese ep11_ho_maya_label_09b1753e_1:

    # my "Thank you, [name]."
    my "谢谢，[name]."

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:423
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_478b9332:

    # mc "How are you feeling?"
    mc "你感觉怎么样？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:425
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_470c863d:

    # js "How am I feeling? I lack the vocabulary to describe it."
    js "我感觉怎么样？我实在找不到合适的词来形容这种感觉。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:426
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_5fd3725c:

    # js "\"Relieved\" is one of the words I'd use. \"Surprised\" is another."
    js "“释然”是我会用的词，“惊讶”也是。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:428
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_fed8c22a:

    # mc "Yeah, it was surprising that Patrick lied to Maya like that. But maybe it shouldn't have been, considering how he treats her."
    mc "嗯，说实话，Patrick骗Maya那件事挺让人意外的。不过想想他平时对她的态度，也许也挺正常的。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:431
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_478b9332_1:

    # mc "How are you feeling?"
    mc "你感觉怎么样？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:433
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_03754481:

    # js "Like I'm a ship at sea with my sails up, but there's nor wind nor motion."
    js "就像一艘帆船在海上，帆都张开了，可既没有风，也没有一丝动静。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:435
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_2b4c4f12:

    # mc "That's a vivid description of it..."
    mc "那可真是个生动的描述……"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:437
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_e53b9a7c:

    # js "I flipped through one of Bella's books while we were waiting for you guys to return."
    js "我翻着贝拉的一本书，等着你们几个回来。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:438
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_4979d758:

    # js "I feel deflated, [name]. And even more so after hearing that Maya wants to call it quits."
    js "[name]，我真的很泄气。听到Maya想放弃这个计划，就更难受了。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:440
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_a6c1ebb5:

    # js "All this time, whenever I saw her smile after we failed - like we did at the Burkes..."
    js "每次我们失败后，看她又露出笑容——比如在伯克家那次……"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:441
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_15f878b7:

    # js "I thought she was coping, not coming to terms with it."
    js "我以为她只是在强撑，不是真的接受了现状。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:445
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_d15caed2:

    # js "What am I going to do, [name]? I must be cursed, just like that mariner who shot the albatross."
    js "[name]，我该怎么办？我一定是被诅咒了，就像那个射杀信天翁的老水手一样。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:447
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_c8155816:

    # mc "The what?"
    mc "什么？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:449
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_5b9db1fc:

    # js "Forget it..."
    js "算了..."

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:454
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_2aefd07c:

    # mc "Why don't you think about what you want?"
    mc "为什么不先想想，你自己想要什么呢？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:455
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_c50b59c6:

    # mc "I know how hard it's been for you to hide the relationship in the past. If this is what's in store for Maya's future, you need to think about what it means for you."
    mc "我知道，你过去为了隐瞒这段关系有多难。如果Maya以后还得这样，你就需要想想，这对你意味着什么。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:457
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_a19d6d15:

    # mc "And what it means for us three."
    mc "对我们三个意味着什么。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:459
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_37cb533f:

    # js "I'm not giving up on us three. No way! We just started."
    js "我没放弃我们三个。绝对不行！我们才刚开始。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:461
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_b5329798:

    # mc "Well, there you have it."
    mc "那你已经有答案了。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:463
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_43b777ee:

    # js "But I didn't expect Maya to give up on fighting for herself. It feels out of the blue to me, but it wasn't sudden to her."
    js "但我没想到Maya会放弃为自己争取。我觉得很突然，可对她来说并不是。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:466
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_aaed03af:

    # js "It means more fights between us, doesn't it? Because that's what it has meant in the past."
    js "这意味着我们之间会有更多冲突，对吧？因为过去就是这样的。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:468
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_4299ee59:

    # mc "It doesn't mean it will be that way in the future."
    mc "这不意味着未来也会是这样。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:470
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_231b1c28:

    # js "I didn't expect Maya to give up fighting for herself. It feels out of the blue to me, but it wasn't sudden to her."
    js "我没想到Maya会放弃为自己争取。我觉得很突然，可对她来说并不是。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:472
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_781e77cf:

    # mc "She deserves to be happy. And so do you."
    mc "她值得幸福，你也是。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:475
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_ad6c6ad2:

    # mc "Try to understand and support her through this."
    mc "试着去理解她，支持她度过这段日子。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:477
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_3f78f179:

    # js "I've always been supportive of her, [name]."
    js "[name]，我一直都很支持她。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:479
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_a57d4cb9:

    # mc "I know you have. And now she needs it more than ever."
    mc "我知道你一直都在。现在她比以往任何时候都更需要你了。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:481
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_231b1c28_1:

    # js "I didn't expect Maya to give up fighting for herself. It feels out of the blue to me, but it wasn't sudden to her."
    js "我没想到Maya会放弃为自己争取。我觉得很突然，可对她来说并不是。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:483
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_57d99e28:

    # js "How was Patrick abusing her? What did you see?"
    js "Patrick是怎么虐待她的？你看到了什么？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:485
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_6485c9d5:

    # mc "He grabbed her arm hard and shook her as he yelled at her. Maya stood up for her mom because she felt Patrick didn't know how to treat her."
    mc "他紧紧抓着她的胳膊，一边摇晃她，一边冲她大吼。Maya当时在替她妈妈说话，因为她觉得Patrick不知道该怎么照顾她妈妈。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:486
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_0810afba:

    # mc "And it's not the first time he's done that to Maya and Derek."
    mc "而且，他已经不是第一次这样对待Maya和Derek了。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:488
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_9dcd3bc6:

    # js "..."
    js "..."

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:490
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_54774929:

    # js "Did you know about this before?"
    js "你之前就知道这件事吗？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:492
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_04e748ba:

    # mc "No. She never told me, but it dawned on me as I saw it happening. I think she tried to tell me in the past."
    mc "不知道。她从没告诉过我，但我亲眼看到时就明白了。我想，她以前曾试着告诉过我。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:494
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_6f94bb37:

    # js "She never told me either. And I thought we shared everything."
    js "她也没跟我说过。我原以为我们什么都说得出来。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:499
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_909efe37:

    # mc "Not everything. Both of you hid me from each other."
    mc "也不是所有事。你们俩不也瞒着彼此，没说过我的事吗？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:501
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_b474f26f:

    # js "Yeah, but this...? It's hard to see why she'd keep it from me. It hurts."
    js "是啊，可这种事……？我很难理解她为什么不告诉我。这让我很难受。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:504
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_fdcb6477:

    # mc "It surprised you, huh?"
    mc "这事儿让你吃了一惊，对吧？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:506
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_68d9c0d1:

    # js "It hurt me... Both that Patrick would do that to her and that she never told me."
    js "这让我很难受……Patrick竟然会这样对她，而她竟然从没告诉过我。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:508
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_8676e33b:

    # mc "I don't think I should speak on Maya's behalf."
    mc "我觉得，我不该替Maya解释。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:509
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_5e825b51:

    # mc "Ask her about this when you see fit."
    mc "找个你觉得合适的时机，问问她吧。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:512
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_2ebc04d8:

    # js "I will, but not tonight. I want her to have this victory."
    js "我会的，但不是今晚。我想让她好好享受这次胜利。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:514
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_13d0bda3:

    # mc "It's a victory for you, too."
    mc "这也是你的胜利。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:516
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_bb98b155:

    # js "Believe me, I'm trying my best to enjoy it."
    js "信我，我正尽力享受这一切。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:519
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_f0b9124c:

    # js "You're awesome..."
    js "你真棒..."

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:526
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_f92efe35:

    # mc "Can I do something for you?"
    mc "我能为你做点什么吗？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:529
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_728255f4:

    # js "Hold me for a while?"
    js "抱我一会儿，好吗？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:534
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_54292228:

    # js "Like what?"
    js "像什么？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:536
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_42592ca5:

    # mc "Whatever you need. If I can help you see things clearly or figure out how you feel..."
    mc "看你需要什么。如果我能帮你理清状况，或者弄明白自己的心情……"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:538
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_86bd6a2f:

    # js "Thanks, but you already have."
    js "谢谢，不过你已经帮到我了。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:540
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_d27c4cd6:

    # mc "Ok... Good."
    mc "好……那就好。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:542
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_d314b1e7:

    # js "(More than you'd ever know.)"
    js "（你帮我的，比你想象的还要多。）"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:545
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_6e7c3e3c:

    # js "Not at the moment."
    js "暂时不用。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:547
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy_label_77da39f3:

    # mc "Ok, I'll be here when you need me."
    mc "好，你需要我时我就会在这里。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:554
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_650cfc46:

    # js "I need to talk to you."
    js "我有话想和你说。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:557
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_79a7ca82:

    # mc "Wanna go somewhere private?"
    mc "想去个私密的地方？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:564
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "..."

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:570
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_9dcd3bc6:

    # js "..."
    js "..."

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:573
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_65adf9e0:

    # js "Thank you for helping Maya."
    js "谢谢你帮了Maya。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:575
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_57184c13:

    # mc "You're welcome."
    mc "不客气。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:576
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_37e5cfe3:

    # mc "It wasn't just for Maya. It was for you too."
    mc "不只是为了Maya，也是为了你。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:578
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_cc70754f:

    # js "I know."
    js "我知道。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:580
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_adb481a2:

    # js "I know things didn't work out as planned tonight...but thanks for trying."
    js "我知道今晚的事没按计划进行...但谢谢你尽力了。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:582
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_ffc1dad8:

    # mc "I feel like I failed her... And I feel like I failed you."
    mc "我感觉我辜负了她……也辜负了你。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:584
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_83a2b6b7:

    # js "You're not just talk, though. You tried your best."
    js "你不是光说说的，你真的尽力了。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:587
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_0d4aaf48:

    # js "I'm still mad at you."
    js "我还在生你的气。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:589
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_cfcc2293:

    # mc "I know."
    mc "我知道。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:590
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_549d0aff:

    # mc "And you have every right to be mad."
    mc "你有充分的理由生气。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:591
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_4f4d98b8:

    # mc "But I hope that one day, someday, any day, you won't be. And that we can patch things up between us."
    mc "但我希望总有那么一天，不管是哪一天，你能不再生气。希望我们还能和好。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:592
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_2b135fb7:

    # mc "I'm still sad about us and how it ended."
    mc "我依然为我们的关系和它这样结束而难过。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:594
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_38b3043b:

    # js "You should be. You missed out on something real, I hope you know."
    js "你是该难过。我希望你知道，你错过的是一段真感情。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:596
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_2b35b6fe_1:

    # mc "..."
    mc "..."

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:598
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_b37a8ab7:

    # js "I can't promise I will ever be ok with what you did. But I'm not blind..."
    js "我不能保证，总有一天我能释怀你做过的事。但我又不瞎……"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:599
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_4ac45400:

    # js "I see what you're doing. I see how much you care."
    js "我明白你在做什么。我看得出你有多在乎。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:601
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_ddd60664:

    # js "Fuck!"
    js "操！"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:603
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_9dcd3bc6_1:

    # js "..."
    js "..."

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:605
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_df24a0e7:

    # js "I am grateful for that. But I am also still very mad."
    js "你做的这些，我很感激。但我也还是很生气。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:610
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_ff29bfd2:

    # js "It will be hard to see you together with Jill."
    js "看到你和Jill在一起，我会很难受。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:611
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_1dd0b39b:

    # js "*{i}Sigh{/i}*"
    js "*{i}叹气{/i}*"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:614
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_5c186338:

    # js "It will be hard to see you together with Sage."
    js "看到你和Sage在一起，我会很难受。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:615
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_1dd0b39b_1:

    # js "*{i}Sigh{/i}*"
    js "*{i}叹气{/i}*"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:618
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_5a2659d3:

    # js "It will be hard to see you together with Bella."
    js "看到你和贝拉在一起会很难受。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:620
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_740943a2:

    # mc "Did...Maya tell you?"
    mc "是……Maya告诉你的？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:622
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_e26941b9:

    # js "So, Maya knows..."
    js "原来Maya也知道……"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:623
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_0113ec9d:

    # js "No. I overheard Jill and Bella talking about it."
    js "不是。我无意间听到了Jill和贝拉谈这件事。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:624
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_9531745a:

    # js "I can't even find the words to discuss that with you; frankly, I don't want to."
    js "我连跟你说这件事都找不到合适的词；说实话，我根本不想说。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:626
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_7e1290d0:

    # mc "Can you avoid spreading it...please?"
    mc "你能别到处传开这件事……求你了？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:628
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_84795e10:

    # js "*{i}Sigh{/i}* From the looks of it, I have to."
    js "*{i}叹气{/i}* 看来，我也只能替你保密了。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:630
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_d2efecf2:

    # mc "Thank you..."
    mc "谢谢..."

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:633
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_9ec4c946:

    # js "How was Patrick abusing Maya?"
    js "Patrick是怎么虐待Maya的？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:634
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_17fd547c:

    # mc "He grabbed her arm real hard and shook her as he yelled at her. Maya was standing up for her mom because she felt Patrick didn't know how to treat her."
    mc "他紧紧抓着她的胳膊，一边摇晃她，一边冲她大吼。Maya当时在替她妈妈说话，因为她觉得Patrick不知道该怎么照顾她妈妈。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:635
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_0810afba:

    # mc "And it's not the first time he's done that to Maya and Derek."
    mc "而且，他已经不是第一次这样对待Maya和Derek了。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:637
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_9dcd3bc6_2:

    # js "..."
    js "..."

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:639
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_9b3239f7:

    # js "Did you know about this?"
    js "你知道这件事吗？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:641
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_04e748ba:

    # mc "No. She never told me, but it dawned on me as I saw it happening. I think she tried to tell me in the past."
    mc "不，她没跟我说过，但当我亲眼看到那件事发生的时候，我突然明白了。我想她以前试着跟我说过。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:643
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_6f94bb37:

    # js "She never told me either. And I thought we shared everything."
    js "她也没跟我说过。我原以为我们什么都说得出来。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:647
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_909efe37:

    # mc "Not everything. Both of you hid me from each other."
    mc "也不是所有事。你们俩不也瞒着彼此，没说过我的事吗？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:649
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_b474f26f:

    # js "Yeah, but this...? It's hard to see why she'd keep it from me. It hurts."
    js "是啊，可这种事……？我很难理解她为什么不告诉我。这让我很难受。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:651
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_fdcb6477:

    # mc "It surprised you, huh?"
    mc "这事儿让你吃了一惊，对吧？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:653
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_68d9c0d1:

    # js "It hurt me... Both that Patrick would do that to her and that she never told me."
    js "这让我很难受……Patrick竟然会这样对她，而她竟然从没告诉过我。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:655
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_d5ebb8bb:

    # mc "I don't think I should speak on Maya's behalf about this."
    mc "这件事，我觉得不该替Maya解释。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:656
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_75604461:

    # mc "Ask her about it when you see fit."
    mc "问她的时候，你挑个合适的时机。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:659
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_2ebc04d8:

    # js "I will, but not tonight. I want her to have this victory."
    js "我会的，但不是今晚。我想让她好好享受这次胜利。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:661
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_780ebdf5:

    # mc "It's a victory for you too."
    mc "这也是你的胜利。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:663
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_e1441c29:

    # js "I'm trying to enjoy it."
    js "我试着享受这一刻。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:667
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_1e8c9142:

    # mc "Thank you for talking to me again. You're strong for doing that."
    mc "谢谢你又和我聊了。你这么做真的很坚强。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:669
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_481a31fc:

    # js "Right..."
    js "是吗……"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:672
translate schinese ep11_ho_josy2_label_0c639e3a:

    # mc "You might not feel like it, but really... You are."
    mc "你可能不觉得自己坚强，但真的……你很坚强。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:685
translate schinese ep11_ho_bella_label_c5d2113d:

    # isa "Do I want to know how you managed to get a hold of those papers, or would that make me your accomplice?"
    isa "你是怎么弄到那些文件的，我该问吗？还是说，知道了就成你的共犯了？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:687
translate schinese ep11_ho_bella_label_54be0db2:

    # mc "We left their house, but I went back there and snuck inside without Patrick noticing me."
    mc "我们离开了他们家，但我又折返回去，趁Patrick没注意，偷偷溜进了屋。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:688
translate schinese ep11_ho_bella_label_4760cabe:

    # mc "I went into his office and rummaged around, but in a delicate way. I wasn't throwing any papers around and tried my best not to leave a trace."
    mc "我进了他的办公室，仔细翻找了一下，但动作很轻柔。我没有乱扔纸张，也尽量不留下任何痕迹。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:690
translate schinese ep11_ho_bella_label_bd74510b:

    # mc "There was even a blank whiteboard in there that I almost drew a cock on, but I stopped myself from doing it."
    mc "里面还有块空白的白板，我差点就在上面画了根鸡巴，不过还是忍住了。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:692
translate schinese ep11_ho_bella_label_d57afdcc:

    # isa "Oh, you poor thing."
    isa "哦，你这可怜的小东西。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:694
translate schinese ep11_ho_bella_label_82996fb7:

    # mc "I know, right?"
    mc "可不是嘛？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:696
translate schinese ep11_ho_bella_label_7478b845:

    # mc "I've already learned my lesson about messing around with whiteboards."
    mc "在白板上乱画这种事，我已经吃过教训了。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:698
translate schinese ep11_ho_bella_label_67d0613c:

    # isa "Hm?"
    isa "嗯？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:700
translate schinese ep11_ho_bella_label_9927e10b:

    # mc "Nothing..."
    mc "没什么……"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:705
translate schinese ep11_ho_bella_label_faa7f4e0:

    # mc "He has a lot of binders, and I went through several of them before finding the right one."
    mc "他有很多文件夹，我翻了好几个才找到那个对的。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:706
translate schinese ep11_ho_bella_label_c6a7e051:

    # mc "I read through a bunch of papers before I located the contract, and then I left without him knowing I was there."
    mc "我翻了一堆文件才找到合同，然后就溜了，他根本不知道我来过。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:707
translate schinese ep11_ho_bella_label_8e3eb92f:

    # mc "You should have seen me; I was a smooth operator."
    mc "你真该看看我当时的样子，办事干净利落。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:709
translate schinese ep11_ho_bella_label_adf70b57:

    # isa "Ok, this does make me your accomplice. I will pretend I didn't hear a word of what you just said."
    isa "好，这让我成了你的共犯。我假装没听到你刚才说的那些话。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:711
translate schinese ep11_ho_bella_label_fcfc4a6d:

    # mc "It felt scummy, but I had to do it for Maya."
    mc "这么干是有点卑鄙，但为了Maya，我非做不可。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:713
translate schinese ep11_ho_bella_label_2af3f94c:

    # isa "You're a wonderful friend to have - larceny put aside."
    isa "你真是个不错的伙伴——把偷窃的事暂且放在一边。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:715
translate schinese ep11_ho_bella_label_15ce3635:

    # mc "Haha! You're right. I am pretty damned wonderful."
    mc "哈哈！你说得对，我确实挺他妈的了不起的。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:717
translate schinese ep11_ho_bella_label_a5cf0c65:

    # isa "Ok, now you're pushing it."
    isa "好了，别得意过头了。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:721
translate schinese ep11_ho_bella_label_9101e21e:

    # isa "Do you want to talk about it?"
    isa "你想聊聊这件事吗？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:723
translate schinese ep11_ho_bella_label_7181b82f:

    # mc "About how I failed to do what Maya trusted me to do? Not really."
    mc "聊我怎么辜负了Maya的信任，没把事情办成？不太想。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:725
translate schinese ep11_ho_bella_label_530270b3:

    # isa "You're being overly harsh on yourself."
    isa "你对自己太苛刻了。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:727
translate schinese ep11_ho_bella_label_f49d22f0:

    # mc "I feel like I let her down. It was harder than I thought it would be."
    mc "我觉得我让她失望了。比我想象中要难多了。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:729
translate schinese ep11_ho_bella_label_8adc1c0f:

    # isa "Things don't always go according to plan, and while it sounded good in theory, there was always a risk that something would go wrong."
    isa "事情不总按计划进行，虽然听起来很美，但总存在出错的可能。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:731
translate schinese ep11_ho_bella_label_1ddb63d1:

    # mc "Yeah, but it sucks... I was right there. It was almost within reach, but I couldn't get it."
    mc "是啊，可就是难受……我当时都已经到那儿了，几乎伸手就能拿到，可还是没拿到。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:733
translate schinese ep11_ho_bella_label_81a33ecb:

    # isa "There are likely other ways to solve this that don't involve theft."
    isa "应该还有其他办法可以解决，不需要偷窃。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:735
translate schinese ep11_ho_bella_label_17dd0feb:

    # mc "Yeah, but she doesn't want to risk anything for her mom's sake."
    mc "嗯，但她在为她妈妈着想，什么都不想冒险。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:737
translate schinese ep11_ho_bella_label_43450c90:

    # isa "What do you mean?"
    isa "你这话是什么意思？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:739
translate schinese ep11_ho_bella_label_743d65ea:

    # mc "Her mom, Helen, is chronically ill and depends on Patrick. Maya fears confronting him about this will make her parents' relationship worse."
    mc "她妈妈Helen长期患病，需要Patrick照顾。Maya担心，要是为了这件事跟他对质，会让父母的关系变得更糟。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:741
translate schinese ep11_ho_bella_label_b11d1134:

    # mc "Even though Patrick treats Maya badly, she still thinks about what's best for her family."
    mc "尽管Patrick对Maya不好，她还是会先考虑怎么做才对家里最好。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:742
translate schinese ep11_ho_bella_label_8c2c601d:

    # mc "How is she able to do that? I don't think I could do it."
    mc "她是怎么做到的？我觉得我做不到。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:744
translate schinese ep11_ho_bella_label_d4315446:

    # isa "That says a lot about her. Putting others before herself like that."
    isa "能这样先替别人着想，足以看出她是个怎样的人。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:746
translate schinese ep11_ho_bella_label_63948e69:

    # mc "It sure does."
    mc "确实如此。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:748
translate schinese ep11_ho_bella_label_de492652:

    # isa "Anyway, you can't expect to be able to solve everyone's problems. You're only human."
    isa "反正你也不能指望自己能解决所有人的问题。你也是人。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:750
translate schinese ep11_ho_bella_label_70f91817:

    # isa "The important thing is that you care and show compassion. That's what she needs now and will remember."
    isa "最重要的是你关心她，表现出同情心。现在她需要这个，也会记住的。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:751
translate schinese ep11_ho_bella_label_75f6d8c6:

    # isa "And if you want to help Maya more, put your energy into making her college stay a happy one. I think it can be."
    isa "如果你想多帮帮她，就把精力放在让她在大学里过得开心些。我觉得是可以做到的。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:756
translate schinese ep11_ho_bella_label_5d3ae8ac:

    # mc "How were things on your end tonight?"
    mc "你今晚那边怎么样？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:758
translate schinese ep11_ho_bella_label_5ea0ed1c:

    # isa "It was a slow night waiting for you guys."
    isa "等你们的时候挺无聊的。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:760
translate schinese ep11_ho_bella_label_39826650:

    # mc "Did you talk to Jill, or was it hard getting a chance to do it?"
    mc "你跟Jill聊了吗？还是一直没找到机会？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:762
translate schinese ep11_ho_bella_label_7cef724b:

    # isa "We...um...talked some."
    isa "我们...呃...聊了聊。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:764
translate schinese ep11_ho_bella_label_b59cf5e6:

    # mc "Did it go well?"
    mc "谈得怎么样？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:766
translate schinese ep11_ho_bella_label_47f53948:

    # isa "Mhm. More or less. We had a good talk."
    isa "嗯，差不多吧。我们聊得挺好的。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:768
translate schinese ep11_ho_bella_label_15d9fe50:

    # mc "Good... I'm glad."
    mc "好……那我就放心了。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:770
translate schinese ep11_ho_bella_label_fb623a7e:

    # isa "..."
    isa "..."

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:776
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_9cb4a462:

    # sa "This song is so good..."
    sa "这首歌真好听……"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:780
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_dba56e1c:

    # sa "Maya, dance with me!"
    sa "Maya，来陪我跳舞！"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:783
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_d961b2b7:

    # my "Maybe later. I'm enjoying my wine here."
    my "等会儿吧。我正喝酒呢。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:785
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_140aa94c:

    # sa "Drink faster!"
    sa "喝快点！"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:787
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_60df8f43:

    # my "Who drinks wine fast?"
    my "谁喝葡萄酒会那么急啊？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:789
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_25bffa50:

    # sa "Good point! We should make sangrias!"
    sa "也是！我们该调点桑格里亚水果酒！"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:792
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_a0276ecc:

    # my "I'm not in a dancing mood tonight."
    my "我今晚没心情跳舞。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:794
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_975c51b8:

    # sa "Dancing makes you feel happier even when you're sad, just like wine!"
    sa "跳舞就算你心情低落也能让你更开心，就像喝酒一样！"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:796
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_f4d82cca:

    # my "Maybe later."
    my "等会儿吧。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:799
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_bd93083c:

    # sa "Jill, get your butt up here and show me your best moves."
    sa "Jill，快起来，让我看看你的拿手舞步。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:801
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_c5b43ee7:

    # ji "None of my moves are that good."
    ji "我的舞步可没那么好。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:803
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_9810d268:

    # sa "Come on, that's horse crap! I'm sure you've got some killer ones. I saw you dance on Halloween!"
    sa "少来，瞎说什么呢！你肯定有几招厉害的。万圣节我见过你跳舞！"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:805
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_cc03ba04:

    # sa "Look, even Bella is dancing."
    sa "你看，连贝拉都在跳呢。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:807
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_21f1fbb4:

    # isa "What? Did you think of me as the least likely to dance?"
    isa "你这是在暗示我最不可能跳舞？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:809
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_78b4e3f1:

    # sa "Haha! Not anymore!"
    sa "哈哈！现在可不一样了！"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:814
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_0d56db94:

    # sa "Hubby!"
    sa "老公！"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:815
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_c7d02dc1:

    # de "Hey..."
    de "嘿..."

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:817
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_b1ab3ee7:

    # de "Listen, I owe you an apology for earlier. You did great today."
    de "听着，之前的事我得向你道歉。你今天做得很棒。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:818
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_b044be16:

    # de "And I...uh... Perhaps I'm more likely to have a friend who's a girl than I thought."
    de "还有，我……呃……也许我也能交到女性朋友，没我想的那么不可能。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:820
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_e11ae49c:

    # sa "Thanks, hubby!"
    sa "谢谢，老公！"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:822
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_e084ce2b:

    # sa "Guys! Guys! We should do this every weekend!"
    sa "伙计们！伙计们！我们每个周末都这么干！"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:824
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_c2584545:

    # isa "Every weekend? I'm not in college anymore."
    isa "每个周末？我早就不是大学生了。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:826
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_e49c22c8:

    # sa "No, but for real! We should party and celebrate things together!"
    sa "不过真的！我们应该一起嗨起来，庆祝一下！"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:828
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_9d642403:

    # sa "Not that tonight is a celebration, but you get my drift."
    sa "今晚可不是庆祝的场合，但你明白我的意思。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:830
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_e064bd63:

    # ji "What are you talking about?"
    ji "你在说什么？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:832
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_361c17e9:

    # sa "Christmas! We should celebrate Christmas! And New Year's! And birthdays!!!"
    sa "圣诞节！我们应该庆祝圣诞节！还有新年！还有生日！！！"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:834
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_2ee39bdb:

    # isa "I'm sure you celebrate that with family and relatives."
    isa "这些节日，你们应该都要和家人亲戚一起过吧。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:836
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_00168b31:

    # sa "*{i}Groans{/i}*"
    sa "*{i}呻吟{/i}*"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:839
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_0f5b8cff:

    # sa "[name]! If you don't dance, you're a party pooper."
    sa "[name]如果你不跳舞，就成聚会扫兴鬼了。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:841
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_348f6708:

    # mc "Are you still dancing?"
    mc "你还在跳舞吗？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:843
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_2864882d:

    # mc "You can dance extra for me. It's nice to see that you're having fun."
    mc "你就连我那份一起跳吧。看你玩得开心，我也高兴。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:845
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_d5b5720c:

    # mc "You can dance extra for me; I'm not feeling it tonight."
    mc "你就连我那份一起跳吧。我今晚没心情。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:848
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_044db315:

    # sa "You did amazing tonight, [name]. Like, wow."
    sa "[name]，你今晚真是太厉害了。简直让我惊呆了。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:849
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_391b0b0a:

    # sa "I hoped you'd make it, but I was still surprised when you did."
    sa "我希望你能成功，可你真的办成了，我还是很惊讶。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:851
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_8f1da190:

    # mc "Yeah, I got lucky."
    mc "我运气不错。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:853
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_e89f5926:

    # sa "You didn't get lucky. Don't give luck any credit; it was all you!"
    sa "才不是什么运气好。别把功劳归给运气，那都是你的本事！"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:855
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_99a264ab:

    # sa "Derek recounted how you did it, and I was in awe."
    sa "Derek跟我讲了经过，我真是佩服得不行。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:856
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_ec505411:

    # sa "You've got such big balls for doing that."
    sa "你敢干这种事，胆子可真够大的。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:859
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_be01a60b:

    # sa "Chin up. You did all that you could. No one blames you for this."
    sa "别垂头丧气了。你已经尽力了，没人怪你。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:861
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_a0d8d2b6:

    # mc "I blame myself."
    mc "我责怪自己。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:863
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_47ca360f:

    # sa "Then you should listen to what we tell you. It's not your fault."
    sa "那你应该听我们的。这不怪你。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:866
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_b7180d16:

    # sa "Come here."
    sa "过来。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:868
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_da58eb55:

    # sa "I'm so happy we're all here like this."
    sa "我们能这样聚在一起，我真的很开心。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:870
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_fa6d583c:

    # sa "Everyone is helping out and being there for each other. I think that's amazing."
    sa "大家都在互相帮助，彼此支持。我觉得这真的很棒。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:872
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_8f11b6ce:

    # sa "Even if it didn't go according to plan, we're still here for each other. I think that's amazing."
    sa "就算计划没按预期进行，我们依然彼此在身边。我觉得这太棒了。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:874
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_0d275a86:

    # mc "That does feel good."
    mc "这感觉真不错。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:876
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_dd7c6d28:

    # sa "We're like a big, true family."
    sa "我们就像一个真正的大家庭。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:878
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_3613f4f8:

    # sa "*{i}Sniffles{/i}*"
    sa "*{i}抽泣{/i}*"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:879
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_ccdfeb21:

    # mc "Sage?"
    mc "Sage？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:881
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_c4d1ab91:

    # mc "(She's trembling...)"
    mc "（她正在发抖……）"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:883
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_da6ac9f0:

    # mc "Follow me."
    mc "跟我来。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:889
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_1d705084:

    # mc "How are you? What's wrong?"
    mc "你怎么样？怎么了？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:891
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_b6f1cbbc:

    # sa "It's my parents. They're getting divorced."
    sa "是我爸妈，他们要离婚了。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:893
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_10173109:

    # mc "What? Oh, no..."
    mc "什么？哦，天啊……"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:896
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_23052542:

    # mc "(This doesn't have anything to do with me...right?)"
    mc "（这跟我没关系……对吧？）"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:898
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_7d010a14:

    # mc "What happened?"
    mc "怎么了？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:900
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_53da6494:

    # sa "They've always fought. It's something I've seen like a million times."
    sa "他们一直都在吵架。这种事情我见得太多了。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:901
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_87acda41:

    # sa "And I've heard Mom threaten Dad with divorce when she got mad, but I never thought it would happen."
    sa "我听妈妈以前气的时候也威胁要跟爸爸离婚，但从来没想过真的会变成现实。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:903
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_cf234cb5:

    # sa "It was just empty threats like, \"If you don't shut up, I'll turn this car around, and we're not going\"."
    sa "那只是空威胁，比如“如果你不停嘴，我就掉头就走，咱们别去了”。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:904
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_4eed191c:

    # sa "But now it is happening for real, and I don't know what to do about it."
    sa "但现在这一切真的发生了，我都不知道该怎么办了。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:906
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_796da4fd:

    # mc "What can I tell you...?"
    mc "我能跟你说什么……？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:907
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_033115d7:

    # mc "These things happen. And it's sad when it affects kids, but..."
    mc "这种事情总会发生。要是影响到孩子就更让人难过，但……"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:908
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_571b2387:

    # mc "If they've been fighting a lot, they're unhappy, right?"
    mc "如果他们经常吵架，那他们肯定不开心吧？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:910
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_eda451dc:

    # sa "I think so, yeah. I can't remember the last time I heard Dad laugh."
    sa "我觉得是这样，对的。我记不清上次听到爸爸笑是什么时候了。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:912
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_277c284c:

    # mc "Then, which is better: being unhappy and staying together or splitting up and trying to find happiness?"
    mc "然后，是该继续在一起忍受不开心，还是分开去寻找幸福呢？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:914
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_be124d9d:

    # sa "I know what you're saying, but for me, it hurts so damned much because..."
    sa "我明白你的意思，可我真的难受得要命，因为……"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:916
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_7165c860:

    # sa "*{i}Exhales{/i}*"
    sa "*{i}呼气{/i}*"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:917
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_34d5fd19:

    # sa "I didn't think I'd lose two families in my lifetime."
    sa "我没想到这辈子会失去两个家。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:918
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_5f28e901:

    # sa "I thought this family was my forever one - the one I deserved."
    sa "我以为，这次终于能有一个永远不会散的家，一个我应得的家。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:920
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_8da4b007:

    # mc "You haven't lost them. They're still your family."
    mc "你没失去他们，他们还是你的家人。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:921
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_79ee3025:

    # mc "Even if things will be different, your mom is still your mom, and your dad is still your dad."
    mc "即使情况变了，你妈还是你妈，你爸还是你爸。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:925
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_29f89828:

    # mc "And unfortunately, your brother is still your brother."
    mc "而且不幸的是，你兄弟还是你兄弟。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:927
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_871b714b:

    # sa "Hahaha!"
    sa "哈哈哈！"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:930
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_b5219ba5:

    # mc "Chin up. You're not alone."
    mc "振作点，你不是一个人。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:933
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_4309f298:

    # mc "It's ok to feel sad. I could tell that something was bothering you today. And let me say I'm amazed you managed to pull through like you did."
    mc "没关系，难过是正常的。我能感觉到你今天有些事情在困扰着你。让我告诉你，我真的很佩服你今天还能坚持过来。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:935
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_a6505111:

    # mc "It's ok to feel sad. I could tell that something was bothering you today. And let me say how strong you are for still wanting to come here."
    mc "没事的，感觉难过也没关系。我能看出来你今天心里有些事。说实话，你还能坚持过来，真的很坚强。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:936
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_7c1d0df2:

    # mc "You're strong as hell, Sage. Don't forget that. You'll be able to handle this, ok?"
    mc "Sage，你真的很坚强。别忘了这一点。你能挺过去的，好吗？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:938
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_6b70821e:

    # mc "And if you need my shoulder, ear, or anything... I'm always here for you."
    mc "要是你需要一个肩膀靠一靠，或者想找人倾诉，不管是什么……我都会在。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:942
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_cf53ed17:

    # sa "*{i}Smack{/i}* Mmm..."
    sa "*{i}亲吻声{/i}* 唔……"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:945
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_e636fb7a:

    # sa "I'm so happy I met you. Thank you, [name]. Thank you."
    sa "能遇见你，我真的好开心。[name]，谢谢你。真的谢谢。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:948
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_90545c3e:

    # mc "*{i}Smack{/i}*"
    mc "*{i}亲吻声{/i}*"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:950
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_020132c3:

    # mc "I know something that might take your mind off things..."
    mc "我知道点东西，能让你暂时忘掉这些烦心事……"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:951
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_ab8752c1:

    # mc "What if you came back home with me tomorrow? You could meet Dad and see where I grew up."
    mc "那你要不要明天跟我一起回家？你可以见见我爸爸，还有看看我长大的地方。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:953
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_94211ee3:

    # sa "I'd like that."
    sa "我很愿意。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:955
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_f49fff8f:

    # mc "Yeah?"
    mc "嗯？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:957
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_191ac2e6:

    # sa "Yes."
    sa "嗯。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:961
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_4506507d:

    # mc "Wanna head back?"
    mc "要回去了吗？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:964
translate schinese ep11_ho_sage_label_1a80acaa:

    # sa "Yeah."
    sa "嗯。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:976
translate schinese ep11_ho_stop_kiss_label_8bf28a8d:

    # mc "Oh... Um... Not in that way."
    mc "哦……呃……不是那个意思。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:978
translate schinese ep11_ho_stop_kiss_label_644adc4b:

    # sa "I'm sad and drunk. I'm looking for comfort; can't you give me that?"
    sa "我很难过，也喝醉了。我想要点安慰，你能不能给我一点？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:980
translate schinese ep11_ho_stop_kiss_label_f6d275ec:

    # mc "I can. But not in that way..."
    mc "我可以。但不是那种方式..."

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:984
translate schinese ep11_ho_stop_kiss_label_dd9add4e:

    # sa "Ok..."
    sa "嗯……"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:988
translate schinese ep11_ho_stop_kiss_label_cf53ed17:

    # sa "*{i}Smack{/i}* Mmm..."
    sa "*{i}亲吻声{/i}* 唔……"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:991
translate schinese ep11_ho_stop_kiss_label_752a5613:

    # sa "Um... Sorry... I'm sad, drunk, and looking for comfort... I shouldn't use you like this."
    sa "呃……对不起……我又难过，又喝醉了，只想找点安慰……不该这样利用你。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:993
translate schinese ep11_ho_stop_kiss_label_6a1891c0:

    # mc "It's ok."
    mc "没关系。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:997
translate schinese ep11_ho_stop_kiss_label_4506507d:

    # mc "Wanna head back?"
    mc "要回去了吗？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1000
translate schinese ep11_ho_stop_kiss_label_1a80acaa:

    # sa "Yeah."
    sa "嗯。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1005
translate schinese ep11_ho_stop_kiss_label_788fa21d:

    # sa "Thank you, [name]."
    sa "谢谢，[name]."

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1007
translate schinese ep11_ho_stop_kiss_label_4506507d_1:

    # mc "Wanna head back?"
    mc "要不要回去了？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1010
translate schinese ep11_ho_stop_kiss_label_1a80acaa_1:

    # sa "Yeah."
    sa "嗯。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1015
translate schinese ep11_ho_stop_kiss_label_e17d7f9b:

    # isa "Sage? Are you ok?"
    isa "Sage？你还好吗？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1017
translate schinese ep11_ho_stop_kiss_label_53ed6710:

    # sa "No. I'm sorry for weirding you guys out tonight."
    sa "不好。对不起，今晚让你们觉得我怪怪的。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1019
translate schinese ep11_ho_stop_kiss_label_fc288f43:

    # isa "Come here. You didn't weird anyone out. Tell me what's wrong."
    isa "过来。没人觉得你奇怪。告诉我怎么了。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1026
translate schinese ep11_ho_derek_label_bbea7d17:

    # mc "Feeling better?"
    mc "感觉好点了吗？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1028
translate schinese ep11_ho_derek_label_e8084c53:

    # de "Yeah."
    de "嗯。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1029
translate schinese ep11_ho_derek_label_9da295e1:

    # de "Maybe it's pompous to say cheers with wine, but...cheers."
    de "拿葡萄酒碰杯可能有点装，不过……干杯。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1032
translate schinese ep11_ho_derek_label_56d7ae3e:

    # mc "At least it's less pompous than cheering with Earl Teabag. Cheers!"
    mc "至少比拿伯爵茶包碰杯没那么装。干杯！"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1034
translate schinese ep11_ho_derek_label_8cfa15bd:

    # de "Good ole Earl... Speaking of him, I like that top hat... But it's hard finding opportunities to wear it."
    de "老伯爵啊……说起来，我挺喜欢那顶高礼帽的……就是没什么机会戴。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1036
translate schinese ep11_ho_derek_label_9dfb1b35:

    # mc "Bro, you wore a dildo helmet to school... Just wear that stupid top hat whenever you want."
    mc "兄弟，你居然戴着假阳具头盔去上学……要不你什么时候想戴就戴那顶蠢帽子吧。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1038
translate schinese ep11_ho_derek_label_64798b74:

    # de "Man's got a point."
    de "这话有道理。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1040
translate schinese ep11_ho_derek_label_e532d80d:

    # mc "Where's your head at tonight?"
    mc "今晚心里在想些什么？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1043
translate schinese ep11_ho_derek_label_aaa361f2:

    # de "I haven't had enough time to process everything. But my gut says things will be good."
    de "我没来得及好好消化这一切。但直觉告诉我一切都会好起来。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1046
translate schinese ep11_ho_derek_label_f22a80b5:

    # de "You know how I feel about it all. I'll support her no matter what she decides."
    de "你明白我的感受。不管她做出什么决定，我都会支持她。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1048
translate schinese ep11_ho_derek_label_473f466d:

    # mc "Are you worried that something will happen with your dad?"
    mc "你担心你爸会出什么事吗？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1051
translate schinese ep11_ho_derek_label_b1fe1d63:

    # de "I've been worried since I came here. I've learned how to live with that feeling."
    de "我从到这里开始就一直担心。我已经学会和这种感觉一起生活了。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1053
translate schinese ep11_ho_derek_label_2957fd6b:

    # mc "Now that I know you're not here to study, I will feel less bad about not sitting next to you in class."
    mc "现在我知道你不是来学习的，我就不那么介意不能坐在你旁边上课了。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1055
translate schinese ep11_ho_derek_label_dee76468:

    # de "You do you, [mc_de]. I don't want you to feel like I'm dragging you down with me if you want to be a nerd."
    de "[mc_de]，你想怎样就怎样。要是你想当个学霸，我可不想让你觉得是我把你带坏了。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1056
translate schinese ep11_ho_derek_label_2b1db205:

    # de "But I'll still save you a seat while I'm here."
    de "但我在的时候还是会给你留个座位。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1061
translate schinese ep11_ho_derek_label_1c323397:

    # isa "It is snowing a lot."
    isa "下雪下得挺大。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1063
translate schinese ep11_ho_derek_label_aa305132:

    # mc "I hope it stops snowing before we leave because I didn't bring a jacket."
    mc "希望我们走之前雪能停，我没带外套。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1065
translate schinese ep11_ho_derek_label_d5d53b19:

    # isa "Why wouldn't you bring a jacket? You could get pneumonia."
    isa "你为什么不带件外套？会得肺炎的。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1067
translate schinese ep11_ho_derek_label_5b79bc5f:

    # mc "Because I'm wearing this warm sweater, and it wasn't cold when we left earlier today."
    mc "因为这件毛衣挺暖和的，而且我们今天出门时还不冷。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1069
translate schinese ep11_ho_derek_label_423e3774:

    # isa "But it's cold now. Did you not think that this would take you all evening?"
    isa "但现在可冷了。你没想过这会持续整个晚上吗？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1071
translate schinese ep11_ho_derek_label_639e577e:

    # de "Hey, back off him! I only brought a vest, and that's not much better."
    de "嘿，别数落他了！我也只带了件背心，没比他强多少。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1073
translate schinese ep11_ho_derek_label_168d0289:

    # isa "So, your defense of [name] is that you make stupid choices, too?"
    isa "所以，你替[name]辩解的理由，就是你也做了同样的蠢事？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1075
translate schinese ep11_ho_derek_label_5eacb8ee:

    # de "You're goddamned right."
    de "你他妈说得对。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1077
translate schinese ep11_ho_derek_label_f5220174:

    # isa "You're lucky I care enough to drive anyone who needs it back home."
    isa "算你们走运，我还愿意操这个心，开车送需要的人回家。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1079
translate schinese ep11_ho_derek_label_9af6222f:

    # de "Then you shouldn't drink more wine."
    de "那你就不该喝更多酒。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1080
translate schinese ep11_ho_derek_label_c299a260:

    # de "Kind of irresponsible, don't you think?"
    de "有点不负责任，对吧？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1085
translate schinese ep11_ho_derek_label_fd3a340c:

    # isa "Or maybe I'll finish this bottle of wine and drive you back home tomorrow."
    isa "或者我直接喝完这瓶酒，明天开车送你回家。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1089
translate schinese ep11_ho_derek_label_f9d940bc:

    # mc "Bro, don't push it... I need to get back home tonight."
    mc "兄弟，别得寸进尺……我今晚还得回家呢。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1091
translate schinese ep11_ho_derek_label_219289a4:

    # de "It's fine; I'll drive you. I'm just having small sips."
    de "没关系，我来开车送你。我只是小口小口地喝。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1098
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_7402203a:

    # mc "I want to thank you for offering to help Maya with her loans."
    mc "谢谢你愿意帮Maya申请贷款。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1100
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_d58a84c2:

    # ji "It's not a problem. I'd just be giving her advice on how to do it."
    ji "这不算什么问题。我只是给她一些建议怎么操作而已。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1102
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_1fb69b92:

    # mc "Yeah, but your support means a lot to her."
    mc "是啊，不过你的支持对她来说很重要。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1104
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_3ab40d5b:

    # mc "I want to thank you for your help."
    mc "我想谢谢你帮忙。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1106
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_16677dae:

    # ji "It doesn't quite feel like I've helped her."
    ji "这感觉好像没真正帮到她。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1108
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_6c0f4845:

    # mc "I know what you mean, but your support means a lot to her."
    mc "我知道你的意思，但你的支持对她来说意义很大。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1110
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_6239aab1:

    # ji "Thanks. As does yours; it's easy to tell."
    ji "谢谢。你的支持也一样，一看就知道。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1113
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_86c42ba1:

    # ji "I feel weird since I know that you've...dated her. But I can see why you care."
    ji "我感觉有点怪，因为我知道你……和她交往过。但我也能理解你为什么这么在意。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1114
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_8a83c222:

    # ji "You've got a big heart."
    ji "你心肠真好。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1116
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_6b0d39de:

    # mc "And for you being able to look past what she's been to me..."
    mc "而且，你能不介意我和她过去的关系……"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1117
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_f384f53c:

    # mc "It's quite amazing."
    mc "这太棒了。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1119
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_1b210b38:

    # ji "I trust you. That's why I can do that."
    ji "我相信你。正因如此，我才能这么做。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1121
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_bb0eeaf4:

    # mc "Thank you."
    mc "谢谢。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1125
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_82ab3e1d:

    # mc "What were you guys up to tonight?"
    mc "你们今晚在干嘛？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1127
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_55b6d0e7:

    # ji "It was such a slow night. We had dinner, but mostly, we were waiting for you to show up."
    ji "这晚上过得挺慢的。我们吃了晚饭，但大部分时间都在等你出现。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1128
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_e859de5c:

    # ji "It wasn't a traditional Thanksgiving by any means, but Thanksgiving has always felt weird to me."
    ji "这算不上传统的感恩节，但感恩节一直让我觉得怪怪的。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1131
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_955190f5:

    # mc "Because of Lana?"
    mc "因为Lana？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1133
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_c8233838:

    # ji "Yes."
    ji "是的。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1135
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_0dd93717:

    # mc "Why's that?"
    mc "为什么？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1137
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_63fddede:

    # ji "Because of my sister."
    ji "因为我的姐姐。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1138
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_3e603482:

    # ji "Her birthday is in December. She passed away the week before it."
    ji "她生日在十二月，但那年她是在生日前一周去世的。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1140
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_8b3c5945:

    # ji "For a holiday with the purpose of giving thanks, it has felt like a yearly slap in the face to my family."
    ji "对于一个本该感恩的节日，它对我们家来说，每年感觉都像是一记耳光。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1141
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_316eec14:

    # ji "There hasn't been much to be thankful for. That's why we don't celebrate it."
    ji "没什么值得感恩的。这就是为什么我们不庆祝这个节日。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1143
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_4cd62758:

    # mc "I thought you said you celebrated it with Bella."
    mc "我以为你刚才说你和贝拉一起庆祝的。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1145
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_33ef803d:

    # ji "I did say that. We managed to turn it into something good."
    ji "我确实这么说过。我们把它变成了一个有意义的事情。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1146
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_214ea9a3:

    # ji "Together, we realized there are things to be thankful for, even when hurting."
    ji "我们一起意识到，即使在痛苦的时候，也有值得感恩的事情。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1148
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_51f89cd5:

    # ji "And it's good to appreciate the little things in life."
    ji "而且，生活中能体会到这些小事情也很美好。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1149
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_1d0f6837:

    # ji "In my memories of my sister, the little things we did together ended up being the big things I remember her for."
    ji "回忆起姐姐，反倒是我们一起做过的那些小事，成了我对她最深刻的记忆。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1151
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_0e382e51:

    # mc "That sounds sweet."
    mc "听起来挺暖心的。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1154
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_ffbf7fbd:

    # ji "Would you like to come with me when I visit her grave?"
    ji "你愿意陪我去看看她坟墓吗？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1156
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_eab3095a:

    # mc "Are you sure you'd want that? It sounds like it's personal to you."
    mc "你确定你真的想这么做吗？听起来对你来说挺私人的。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1158
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_96dc1498:

    # ji "It is. But she never got to meet you. And this is as close as it gets."
    ji "是很私人的事。可她没机会见到你了，这已经是最接近让你们见面的方式。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1159
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_4f70f8b6:

    # ji "It would mean a lot to me."
    ji "这对我意义重大。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1161
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_72882986:

    # mc "I wouldn't want to miss it."
    mc "我可不想错过。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1165
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_2d0be0c5:

    # ji "What about your Thanksgivings? Tell me. How have they been?"
    ji "那你呢？跟我说说，你以前都是怎么过感恩节的？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1167
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_92679b91:

    # mc "They've been ordinary and laid back. Dad and I usually share a good meal, but that's pretty much it."
    mc "它们过得挺普通，也挺随意的。我和爸爸通常会一起吃顿不错的饭，但也就这么多了。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1169
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_974bd881:

    # ji "You don't watch the game or something?"
    ji "你就不看比赛什么的？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1171
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_8b38b437:

    # mc "No TV, remember?"
    mc "没电视，记得吗？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1173
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_3a2da1cb:

    # ji "I...don't remember you telling me that."
    ji "我……不记得你跟我说过这个。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1175
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_fbd92dc7:

    # mc "Oh, I'm sorry. I thought I did. I never had one growing up."
    mc "哦，抱歉，我以为说过。我从小到大，家里都没有电视。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1177
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_e5868c20:

    # ji "Ah... It would be hard to watch the game without one."
    ji "啊……没有电视的话，看比赛也挺难的。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1179
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_ad1929a6:

    # mc "Haha, yeah."
    mc "哈哈，是啊。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1181
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_7aeedbd3:

    # mc "Um... Here's a thought... Would you like to come back home with me tomorrow?"
    mc "嗯……有个主意，你明天想跟我一起回家吗？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1183
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_58f81a15:

    # ji "For your Thanksgiving celebration?"
    ji "为了你的感恩节庆祝？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1185
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_ecf34fb9:

    # mc "\"Celebration\" is a strong word for it. But yeah, I'm sure Dad would love to meet you."
    mc "说是“庆祝”有点夸张。不过是啊，爸爸一定很想见见你。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1187
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_db58f4b6:

    # ji "I'd be delighted to, if it's ok with this short notice."
    ji "我很乐意，只要这么临时过去不会添麻烦。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1189
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_b6dad28d:

    # mc "Yeah, it won't be a problem. Trust me."
    mc "没问题，相信我。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1190
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_40208c2e:

    # mc "I'll be staying over until Sunday; are you up for that?"
    mc "我会住到周日才走；你有空吗？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1192
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_3e21e764:

    # ji "Oh... I made plans with Sage on Saturday."
    ji "哦……我周六和Sage约好了。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1194
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_0509de32:

    # mc "With Sage?"
    mc "和Sage？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1196
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_1b35f1f6:

    # ji "Yes, I'm sorry. But I can stay overnight, at least."
    ji "是的，抱歉。不过我至少可以住一晚。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1198
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_37c2fb90:

    # mc "That will work, too."
    mc "这也可以。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1200
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_3086eb95:

    # ji "Great!"
    ji "好！"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1202
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_ae10b64d:

    # mc "You and Sage, huh? What are you two up to?"
    mc "你和Sage？你们俩有什么安排？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1204
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_437fbba6:

    # ji "She wanted me to show her where I get my nails done, and I suggested we could make a day out of it."
    ji "她想让我带她去我做美甲的地方，我就提议干脆一起出去玩一天。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1206
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_ce37b791:

    # mc "That's so nice of you. She could use it."
    mc "这真够体贴的。她正需要这个。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1207
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_fa332600:

    # mc "I mean, not that her nails are ugly, but she could use some time off thinking about her parents."
    mc "我是说，不是嫌她指甲难看，只是她需要暂时放下父母的事，散散心。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1209
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_23310991:

    # ji "Haha, [name]... I got what you meant."
    ji "哈哈，[name]我明白你的意思了。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1211
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_9c996e4a:

    # mc "Ok. Good."
    mc "好。行。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1216
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_ffbf7fbd_1:

    # ji "Would you like to come with me when I visit her grave?"
    ji "你愿意陪我去她墓地吗？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1218
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_001477ea:

    # mc "You'd...want me to come?"
    mc "你……想让我一起去？"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1220
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_eebdbdae:

    # ji "It would mean a lot to me to show you."
    ji "能带你去看看，对我来说很重要。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1222
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_7bf19a64:

    # mc "If it's important to you, I wouldn't want to miss it."
    mc "如果对你来说很重要，我可不想错过。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1227
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_cf680276:

    # ji "I'm happy I came here tonight."
    ji "我今晚能来这儿，挺开心的。"

# episode11\ep11_hangout.rpy:1229
translate schinese ep11_ho_jill_label_a8dc8d6f:

    # mc "I am, too. And Bella as well, I'm sure."
    mc "我也是。贝拉肯定也是。"

